IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `sg-core`
IMPORT `sga2-nouns`
IMPORT `sga2-s76-exceptions`

-- Tests for sga2-s76-exceptions.l4: s 76(8), (8A) and (9) of the Companies Act 1967 (Singapore).
-- Expected values are written from the text (inputs/CoA1967.txt lines 7436-7585), beside each assertion.
-- Every carve-out answers JUST TRUE when its facts bring the act within it and NOTHING when they do not (the paragraph then says nothing; subsection (1) or (1A) decides).

§ `s 76(8)(a) to (f): dividends, winding up, reduction of capital, liabilities, court orders, arrangements`

-- (a) a distribution of a company's assets by way of dividends lawfully made: both facts.
#ASSERT `s 76(8)(a) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is a lawful dividend` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 76(8)(a) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is a lawful dividend` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 76(8)(a) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is a lawful dividend` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (aa) a distribution in the course of a company's winding up.
#ASSERT `s 76(8)(aa) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is a distribution in a winding up` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 76(8)(aa) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is a distribution in a winding up` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (b) a payment pursuant to a reduction of capital in accordance with Division 3A of Part 4.
#ASSERT `s 76(8)(b) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is a payment on a reduction of capital` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 76(8)(b) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is a payment on a reduction of capital` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 76(8)(b) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is a payment on a reduction of capital` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (c) the discharge of a liability incurred in good faith as a result of a transaction on ordinary commercial terms.
#ASSERT `s 76(8)(c) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is the discharge of a liability incurred in good faith` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 76(8)(c) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is the discharge of a liability incurred in good faith` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 76(8)(c) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is the discharge of a liability incurred in good faith` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 76(8)(c) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is the discharge of a liability incurred in good faith` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (d) anything done pursuant to an order of Court made under section 210.
#ASSERT `s 76(8)(d) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is done under an order made under section 210` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 76(8)(d) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is done under an order made under section 210` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (e) anything done under an arrangement made pursuant to section 178 of the Insolvency, Restructuring and Dissolution Act 2018.
#ASSERT `s 76(8)(e) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is done under an arrangement under section 178 of the Insolvency, Restructuring and Dissolution Act 2018` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 76(8)(e) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is done under an arrangement under section 178 of the Insolvency, Restructuring and Dissolution Act 2018` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (f) anything done under an arrangement with creditors binding on them by virtue of section 187 of that Act: both facts.
#ASSERT `s 76(8)(f) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is done under an arrangement binding on creditors under section 187 of the Insolvency, Restructuring and Dissolution Act 2018` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 76(8)(f) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is done under an arrangement binding on creditors under section 187 of the Insolvency, Restructuring and Dissolution Act 2018` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 76(8)(f) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is done under an arrangement binding on creditors under section 187 of the Insolvency, Restructuring and Dissolution Act 2018` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `s 76(8)(g): a guarantee or security by a subsidiary of a borrowing corporation`

-- Arguments: liability to repay money; money received in response to an invitation to the public for debentures; the other corporation controls the board; controls more than half the votes;
-- the company is a subsidiary of a subsidiary; the act is a guarantee; the act is security; in good faith; in the ordinary course of commercial dealing.
#ASSERT `s 76(8)(g) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is a guarantee or security by a subsidiary of a borrowing corporation` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 76(8)(g) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is a guarantee or security by a subsidiary of a borrowing corporation` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 76(8)(g) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is a guarantee or security by a subsidiary of a borrowing corporation` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- The corporation is not a borrowing corporation (no liability to repay, or the money did not come in response to an invitation to the public for debentures).
#ASSERT `s 76(8)(g) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is a guarantee or security by a subsidiary of a borrowing corporation` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 76(8)(g) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is a guarantee or security by a subsidiary of a borrowing corporation` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- The company is not a subsidiary of the borrowing corporation on any of the three limbs.
#ASSERT `s 76(8)(g) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is a guarantee or security by a subsidiary of a borrowing corporation` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- The act is neither a guarantee nor security.
#ASSERT `s 76(8)(g) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is a guarantee or security by a subsidiary of a borrowing corporation` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Not in good faith; not in the ordinary course of commercial dealing.
#ASSERT `s 76(8)(g) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is a guarantee or security by a subsidiary of a borrowing corporation` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 76(8)(g) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is a guarantee or security by a subsidiary of a borrowing corporation` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `s 76(8)(ga) to (l)`

-- (ga) a representation, warranty or indemnity in good faith and in the ordinary course of commercial dealing in relation to an offer to the public of shares in that company.
#ASSERT `s 76(8)(ga) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is a representation, warranty or indemnity on an offer to the public` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 76(8)(ga) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is a representation, warranty or indemnity on an offer to the public` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 76(8)(ga) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is a representation, warranty or indemnity on an offer to the public` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 76(8)(ga) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is a representation, warranty or indemnity on an offer to the public` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 76(8)(ga) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is a representation, warranty or indemnity on an offer to the public` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (h) the purchase by a company of shares in the company pursuant to an order of a Court.
#ASSERT `s 76(8)(h) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is a purchase of the company's shares under an order of a Court` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 76(8)(h) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is a purchase of the company's shares under an order of a Court` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (i) a lien on shares in the company (other than fully-paid shares) for an amount payable in respect of the shares, in good faith and in the ordinary course.
-- Arguments: lien created or acquired; the shares are fully paid; the lien is for an amount payable in respect of the shares; good faith; ordinary course.
#ASSERT `s 76(8)(i) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is a lien on shares that are not fully paid` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 76(8)(i) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is a lien on shares that are not fully paid` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 76(8)(i) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is a lien on shares that are not fully paid` FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 76(8)(i) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is a lien on shares that are not fully paid` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 76(8)(i) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is a lien on shares that are not fully paid` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 76(8)(i) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is a lien on shares that are not fully paid` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (j) an agreement with a subscriber for shares permitting payment by instalments, in good faith and in the ordinary course.
#ASSERT `s 76(8)(j) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is an agreement for payment by instalments` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 76(8)(j) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is an agreement for payment by instalments` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 76(8)(j) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is an agreement for payment by instalments` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 76(8)(j) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is an agreement for payment by instalments` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 76(8)(j) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is an agreement for payment by instalments` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (k) an allotment of bonus shares.
#ASSERT `s 76(8)(k) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is an allotment of bonus shares` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 76(8)(k) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is an allotment of bonus shares` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (l) a redemption of redeemable shares in accordance with the company's constitution.
#ASSERT `s 76(8)(l) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is a redemption in accordance with the constitution` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 76(8)(l) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is a redemption in accordance with the constitution` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 76(8)(l) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is a redemption in accordance with the constitution` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `s 76(8A) and (8)(m): odd-lots`

-- (8A)(a): an odd-lot is an amount of shares less than a board lot: 99 of 100 is; exactly 100 is not; 101 is not.
#ASSERT `s 76(8A)(a) the holding is an odd-lot` 99 100 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 76(8A)(a) the holding is an odd-lot` 100 100 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 76(8A)(a) the holding is an odd-lot` 101 100 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 76(8A)(a) the holding is an odd-lot` 0 1000 EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (8A)(b): a board lot is a standard unit of trading of the exchange on which the company is listed.
#ASSERT `s 76(8A)(b) the amount of shares is a board lot` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 76(8A)(b) the amount of shares is a board lot` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (8A)(c): "rounding off any odd-lots" includes a shareholder who owns only odd-lots disposing all of them.
#ASSERT `s 76(8A)(c) the act is within rounding off any odd-lots` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 76(8A)(c) the act is within rounding off any odd-lots` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 76(8A)(c) the act is within rounding off any odd-lots` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (8)(m) arguments: admitted to the official list of an approved exchange in Singapore; removed from it; listed on a securities exchange outside Singapore; the act is payment of costs; the scheme is for rounding off odd-lots.
#ASSERT `s 76(8)(m) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is the payment of the costs of an odd-lot scheme` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 76(8)(m) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is the payment of the costs of an odd-lot scheme` FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Admitted but since removed from the official list, and not listed elsewhere: not "listed" (s 4(1)).
#ASSERT `s 76(8)(m) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is the payment of the costs of an odd-lot scheme` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 76(8)(m) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is the payment of the costs of an odd-lot scheme` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 76(8)(m) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is the payment of the costs of an odd-lot scheme` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `s 76(8)(n) and (o): the savings`

-- "nothing in this subsection (n) is to be construed as implying ...; or (o) is to be construed as limiting ...": flat negatives for the acts subsection (8) names.
#ASSERT `s 76(8)(n) subsection (8) implies that the act would otherwise be prohibited by subsection (1) or (1A)` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 76(8)(n) subsection (8) implies that the act would otherwise be prohibited by subsection (1) or (1A)` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 76(8)(o) subsection (8) limits the operation of a rule of law permitting the act` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 76(8)(o) subsection (8) limits the operation of a rule of law permitting the act` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `s 76(9): banking, employees, buy-backs`

-- (9)(a) arguments: loan, guarantee or security in connection with loans; in the ordinary course of business; regulated by banking, finance companies or insurance law; supervised by the Monetary Authority of Singapore;
-- done in the course of those activities; on ordinary commercial terms.
#ASSERT `s 76(9)(a) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is ordinary banking, finance or insurance business` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 76(9)(a) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is ordinary banking, finance or insurance business` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Neither regulated by such a law nor supervised by the Monetary Authority of Singapore.
#ASSERT `s 76(9)(a) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is ordinary banking, finance or insurance business` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 76(9)(a) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is ordinary banking, finance or insurance business` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 76(9)(a) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is ordinary banking, finance or insurance business` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 76(9)(a) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is ordinary banking, finance or insurance business` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 76(9)(a) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is ordinary banking, finance or insurance business` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (9)(b) arguments: the act is assistance for an acquisition of shares of the company or its holding company; for employees of the company; for employees of a related corporation; the s 6 fact; for a salaried director.
#ASSERT `s 76(9)(b) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is assistance for the acquisition of shares for employees` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 76(9)(b) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is assistance for the acquisition of shares for employees` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Employees of a corporation that is not related to the company (the s 6 fact is false): not covered.
#ASSERT `s 76(9)(b) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is assistance for the acquisition of shares for employees` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 76(9)(b) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is assistance for the acquisition of shares for employees` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 76(9)(b) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is assistance for the acquisition of shares for employees` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 76(9)(b) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is assistance for the acquisition of shares for employees` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (9)(c) a buy-back in accordance with ss 76B to 76G (another part's question, taken as a fact).
#ASSERT `s 76(9)(c) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is a buy-back in accordance with sections 76B to 76G` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 76(9)(c) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is a buy-back in accordance with sections 76B to 76G` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
